=2 Walkthrough
* After completing {q:The Crimson Trial|The Crimson Trial|The Crimson Trial} and attaining level 50+ {p:Red Mage}, speak to {p:Curilla} (I-9) in {z:Chateau d'Oraguille}. You will receive the {k:Old pocket watch}.
** You no longer have to be on RDM after starting the quest.
** Players from {p:San d'Oria} must be rank 2, but players from other nations must be on at least {M:Bastok|Bastok Mission 2-3|The Emissary} / {M:Windurst|Windurst Mission 2-3|The Three Kingdoms} **Mission 2-3** and able the enter {z:Chateau d'Oraguille}.
** Depending on your character's progress, you may get both the {p:Savage Blade} and {q:The General's Secret|The General's Secret|The General's Secret} quests first.
* Next go to the Cathedral (back in {z:Northern San d'Oria}, exit the {z:Chateau d'Oraguille}) and speak to {n:Pagisalis} in the basement. He will request a {i:Velvet Cloth|Velvet Cloth|828}.
** The basement stairs are to the left after entering the Cathedral.
* Trade him a {i:Velvet Cloth|Velvet Cloth|828}. You will obtain a pair of {k:Old boots} in exchange for the {k:Old pocket watch}.
* Speak to {p:Curilla} again.
* Head to {z:Crawlers' Nest} and open a {p:Treasure Chest} (blue dots on the map below) using a {i:Nest Chest Key|Nest Chest Key|1040} to obtain the key item {k:Crawler blood}.
** You can purchase a {i:Nest Chest Key|Nest Chest Key|1040} from the {p:Curio Vendor Moogle} if you have obtained the {k:"Rhapsody in White"} key item by completing {M:Rhapsodies of Vanadiel Mission 1-6|Rhapsodies of Vanadiel Mission 1-6|Flames of Prayer}.
** The chest has a 3 minute re-spawn time.
* On Map 2 at (I-10) examine the **???**. A dialog will ask if you want to bury the {@k} {k:Old boots} and {@k} {k:Crawler blood}, of course you do.
** If you get a message "Someone has been digging here" you have forgotten to talk to {p:Curilla} after trading the {i:Velvet Cloth|Velvet Cloth|828}.
* Check the **???** again after about a minute to obtain the {i:Warlock's Boots|Warlock's Boots|14093} (zoning not required).

